  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Malthe Winje AS Feasibility study Phase II small hydropower East-Africa</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Feasbility study phase II of small hydropower projects in East-Africa. MW has indentified a project portfolio of 10 potential small hydropower projects in Kenya, Tanzania and Uganda, they want to develop on a BOT basis (build, own, operate, transfer) with local partners, MW has recieved Norad support to develop 3 projects to Financial Close and wants to continue with the next 5 projects to undertake technical studies, environmental studies, financial and legal due diligence in Phase II.</narrative>
  </description>
